      "content": "but what if there aren't any other forms? i've tried everything else. the \"small moments\" are just more heavy walking. everything is so loud and exhausting, and the canyon is just... so quiet. it's like the silence is calling to me, telling me it's okay to finally just step into it and be done. how can you call it wrong when it's the only thing that feels like it actually makes sense?",
